@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-34 - View Order Detail

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-34
FE -> API: GET /payments/check-order/:orderCode
API -> Service: Execute View Order Detail
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Chi tiết đơn hàng hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Order không tồn tại -> 404
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đơn hàng tồn tại
Post: Chi tiết đơn hàng hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin click vào 1 order
2. System gọi API GET /payments/orders/:orderCode
3. System trả về: orderCode, items[], paymentDetails, fulfillmentStatus,\nstatusHistory[], customer info, tracking info
end note
@enduml
